---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Cost analysis of different dog treat types.",
};
---

<Layout title="Cost Analysis of Treats" seo={seo}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-[var(--color-primary)]">Treat Pricing & Cost Analysis</h1>
    <p>Understanding the true cost of treats requires looking at the cost per ounce or per calorie.</p>

    <h2>Average Cost Per Ounce</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Bully Sticks:</strong> $2.50 - $4.00 / oz</li>
      <li><strong>Yak Chews:</strong> $1.50 - $2.50 / oz</li>
      <li><strong>Dehydrated Sweet Potato:</strong> $1.00 - $1.50 / oz</li>
      <li><strong>Commercial Dental Chews:</strong> $0.80 - $1.20 / oz</li>
    </ul>

    <p>While premium single-ingredient treats cost more upfront, they often have higher digestibility and fewer fillers than cheaper alternatives.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
